The benchmark data under data/ includes material derived from NVIDIA's
Nemotron-Personas-USA dataset. Nemotron-Personas-USA is released by NVIDIA
under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0).
The source dataset and its license are available at:
https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/Nemotron-Personas-USA

The ATRBench authors selected and transformed synthetic personas from that
source and authored the benchmark rules, sessions, environments, and metadata.
